DATA BINDING (P1/S8 — no HTTP in the view)
  Two cache-then-network raw-JSON reads + two non-throwing suspend Result mutations flow through the shared
  ChargingRepository (ChargingRepository.kt L94-126). The host builds HttpChargingRepository(container.api,
  container.cacheStore) (the Android graph wires no ChargingStore yet) exactly like ChargingCurvePageHost.
  The two JsonElement feeds are projected to UiState<JsonElement> via BaseFeedViewModel.asUiState and decoded
  at the display boundary (SmartChargePageModel.decodeRatePlans/decodeChargePlans); the optimize response is
  decoded by the view-model (decodeOptimizeResult) into the typed result the panels render. SI stays SI; the
  only display conversion is monetary + localized date/time at the SmartChargeFormatters boundary (web S5).

